body:
This app helps me complete my daily or weekly tasks. 

As Jocko Willink says, &#34;Discipline equals freedom.&#34; 

With Streaks I have more freedom.

I think this app is simple and that is perfect. There is limitless potential. Two things I would like to see happen in the near future is:

- Allow the person to add more than 6 items. You can categorize must do&#39;s (that can be limited to 6) and the others can be &#34;if you have time today.&#34; 

- Tie in to do items with each other. You can check off &#34;X item&#34; until you brush your teeth or until the fitness tracker says you went for your run.
